.venv/
__pycache__/

# Sweep output is regenerable and noisy, so bench/results is ignored by default.
# Any artifact a commit cites as the basis of a decision is kept: a figure whose
# evidence exists only on one box is a rumour with a timestamp, and Phase-0 exit
# asserts figures_have_provenance.
#
# This used to be a list of individual filenames, and the list failed twice in
# the way lists do — silently. Three commits on 2026-09-15 described results in
# detail and committed none of them, because `git add` obeyed the ignore and said
# nothing, and `git commit` reported success. Nobody lied; the record was simply
# missing, which is worse than a wrong number because there is nothing to check.
#
# So the exception is by FAMILY, not by name. A new run of a harness that already
# has provenance is kept automatically; a genuinely new kind of sweep needs one
# line here, which is a deliberate act rather than a thing to remember.
bench/results/*
!bench/results/phase0-*
!bench/results/coresidency-probe-*
!bench/results/provenance-*
!bench/results/harmony-*
!bench/results/judge-fitness-*
!bench/results/controller-fitness-*
!bench/results/format-support-*
!bench/results/size-sweep-*
